a5194c27ee0a"],

Cell["\<\
The designation of 5 amp hours (5 AH) is somewhat nominal. But if it was 5 AH \
= 5 A \[Times] 3600 s, then as power = Volts \[Times] Amps and energy = Watts \
\[Times] Seconds :\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.931427920844942*^9, 3.931428021270067*^9}, {
  3.931428174469879*^9, 3.93142821027781*^9}, {3.9314288050196943`*^9, 
