Cell["\<\
This suggests that the battery will would store up to around 360 kJ of energy. 
However, the actual value is a little less. According to the value showed on \
the underside of the battery it can store 90 WH (Watt Hours) = 90 W \[Times] \
3600 s:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.931427920844942*^9, 3.931428021270067*^9}, {
  3.931428174469879*^9, 3.93142821027781*^9}, {3.9314288050196943`*^9, 
