Cell["\<\
Somewhat better than the smaller 1.7 AH battery. The difference in energy \
density is like mainly due to the packaging difference. The two battery \
chemistries are probably the same (i.e., the energy densities of the battery \
chemistry (without the packaging) is probably over 500 kJ/kg).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.950020428849723*^9, 3.950020445767668*^9}, {
  3.950020481592651*^9, 3.950020609637392*^9}, {3.9500251517436047`*^9, 
  3.950025152201687*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4764641e-f811-420e-a125-\
940a7ddcefb2"]
}, Open  ]],

