Cell["\<\
When looking at the step motor from the front clockwise (CW) rotation is \
caused by -ve micro-steps and counter-clockwise (CCW) rotation is caused by \
+ve micro-steps
We need to tell the Silent Stepper how quickly to accelerate and decelerate. \
The maximum for both is:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.935489009219194*^9, 3.935489067258821*^9}, {
   3.935489797795402*^9, 3.935489863995572*^9}, {3.9354898976275177`*^9, 
   3.935489901810812*^9}, {3.935489964122962*^9, 3.935490205025538*^9}, {
