  3.935606420863674*^9, 3.935606450727297*^9}, {3.935658376634556*^9, 
  3.935658377482896*^9}, {3.9356720489271317`*^9, 
  3.93567204905401*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5ad87e11-6eae-43fc-a7a8-\
cabfb47e3c26"],

Cell["\<\
We will rotate clockwise by 1 rev in about 10 s, then pause for about 2 s, \
then rotate counter-clockwise by 1 rev in about another 10 s. Note that we \
have to consider the effect of the acceleration and deceleration times.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.935665434121297*^9, 3.9356654887170963`*^9}, {
  3.935665877682253*^9, 3.935665878267982*^9}, {3.935671082129032*^9, 
  3.9356710822162237`*^9}, {3.935672065864045*^9, 3.935672127525559*^9}, {
  3.935672461239934*^9, 
  3.9356724747023783`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cd7fab15-64d7-490e-9d51-\
f401a704cca2"],

